{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36677","headline":"宿荆州江陵驿 · 罗隐","name":"宿荆州江陵驿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西游象阙媿知音，东下荆溪称越吟。\n风动芰荷香四散，月明楼阁影相侵。\n闲欹别枕千般梦，醉送征帆万里心。\n薜荔衣裳木兰檝，异时烟雨好追寻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36677.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36677","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}